sequenceDiagram
    actor Developer
    participant Server as TS server
    participant Test as web_platform_curriculum_e2e
    participant Client as ureq client
    participant Assert as StepResult assertions

    Developer->>Server: start serve --port 3099
    Developer->>Test: EATME_WEB_PLATFORM=1 cargo test -p eatme-alice --test web_platform_curriculum_e2e
    Test->>Client: load scenario steps + base URL
    Client->>Server: GET /api/health
    Client->>Server: POST /api/launch
    Client->>Server: POST /api/scene/add-object
    Client->>Server: POST /api/code/edit-procedure
    Client->>Server: POST /api/world/run
    Client->>Server: POST /api/project/save
    Client->>Server: POST /api/events/register
    Server-->>Assert: JSON responses
    Assert-->>Developer: curriculum scenario verdicts
